<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila C. Bank sets overnight lending at 26 pct.</title>
<headline>Manila C. Bank sets overnight lending at 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank said on Thursday it had set its overnight lending rate at 26 percent from a previous 17 percent.</p>
<p>The adjustment in the rate came after the Central Bank raised its overnight borrowing rate by nine percentage points to 24 percent yesterday.</p>
<p>The Central Bank had to raise its rate to defend the peso against speculation after Thailand decided to adopt a managed float of its currency on Wednesday.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
